# FluffyFriends — Cursor project guidance

_Use this file for orientation; use `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for the full surface map, contracts, and Known Issues. Design detail lives in `.cursor/rules/fluffyfriends-design-system.mdc` and `app/globals.css`._

**Foundations reflected here:** major work from **Mar–May 2026** (digital sketchbook baseline, preview-first commerce, campaign surfaces, admin analytics, download/URL contracts, checkout upscale gate, CI). Omitting one-off copy or small UI tweaks.

---

## Architecture (read first)

- **Map of routes, n8n workflows, DB touches, and Known Issues:** `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` — cross-check any multi-file change against it; update entries when a brief ships.

**Three principles** (from ARCHITECTURE — do not contradict in new code):

1. **Portrait lifecycle ≠ single purchase** — a portrait can accumulate multiple commercial events over time; avoid “one row = one simplistic story” assumptions.
2. **Generation ≠ fulfillment** — WF2/WF3 produce assets; delivery (email, downloads, future print) is downstream. WF3 “ready” means upscale URLs are real, not placeholders.
3. **`/my-portraits` is commerce** — downloads, credits, future print upsell; keep CTAs and layout compatible with that future.

---

## Product & pipeline (high level)

- **Preview-first:** watermarked preview before pay; **NEW WF3** (Stripe path) upscales after payment; **OLD WF3** still applies to some **returning-customer** triggers via `/api/trigger-generation` — see ARCHITECTURE for IDs and webhooks.
- **Cloudinary URLs in `pet_portraits`:** Mid-WF3, `landscape_url` / `portrait_url` may temporarily match **`image_url`** (AVIF preview placeholder). **Upscale complete** is signaled when **`landscape_url` ≠ `image_url`** (upscaled JPG vs preview). Admin or other readers of those columns should know this window exists.
- **`/checkout/success`:** Polls until upscale is complete **and** enforces a **minimum ~30s loader** before redirect; **90s hard fallback** still redirects. Do not revert to “`landscape_url` is non-null only” — that reintroduces the AVIF download race.
- **`/my-portraits`:** Sole place for **customer download** links; URLs must go through **`getDownloadUrl()`** in `lib/cloudinary.ts` (**JPG + attachment + q_100**). Recovery/preview use **`applyWatermark()`** only — not the same as downloads.
- **`/api/validate-voucher`:** Stripe promotion codes for `/create`; URL `?promo=` auto-apply is a **known gap** (see ARCHITECTURE).
- **Deep links:** `/create?theme=&name=&promo=` (occasion landings); `/mothers-day` also uses `?pet=cat|dog` toward create when needed.

---

## Major surfaces (where to look)

| Area | Primary files |
|------|----------------|
| Homepage **seasonal campaign** (optional) | `app/page.tsx`, `components/seasonal-campaign-section.tsx` — set `ACTIVE` to show the card; `null` hides it (inactive after Mother’s Day 2026 until next promo e.g. Father’s Day — see ARCHITECTURE) |
| **Create** funnel | `app/create/page.tsx`, `components/preview-reveal-stage-b.tsx` |
| **Checkout success** / WF3 gate | `app/checkout/success/page.tsx` |
| **My portraits** / downloads | `app/my-portraits/*`, `lib/cloudinary.ts` |
| **Recovery preview** | `app/preview/[id]/page.tsx` |
| **Mother’s Day** | `app/mothers-day/*` |
| **Blog** | `app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx`, `content/blog/*.mdx` |
| **PetMaster** | `app/petmaster/*`, `/api/petmaster-analytics`, etc. |

---

## Design system (Digital Sketchbook)

- **Full baseline:** `.cursor/rules/fluffyfriends-design-system.mdc` — typography, checkout step UX, logos, section layout, checkout success 4-step pattern.
- **Tokens & utilities:** `app/globals.css` — use **semantic Tailwind tokens** (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `border-border`, `bg-card`, …). **No new arbitrary hex** in components; **no `rounded-full`** for new UI — use `rounded-organic` / `rounded-organic-sm`.
- **Shell:** `Navbar` → `<main className="min-h-screen bg-background">` → `Footer`; sections `py-14 md:py-20`, container `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6`; **`<SketchDivider />`** between major sections.
- **Buttons:** `components/ui/button.tsx` with organic radius.

---

## Quality & CI

- **GitHub Actions (`dev` / `staging`):** `npm ci` → **`npx tsc --noEmit`** → **`npm run build`** (with placeholder env for Supabase public vars). Ship changes that keep **TypeScript clean** and **build green**.

---

## Rule maintenance

- Large **foundational** shifts (new flows, contracts, major routes) → update **`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`** and add or adjust a **short pointer** in this file when it helps every future session.
- Pure design-only changes → **`fluffyfriends-design-system.mdc`** / **`docs/DESIGN_BASELINE.md`** as already documented there.
